B.eAB=new A.em("honor","Honor Magic V5","\ud83d\udcf1",B.cr,"One of the thinnest foldable phones. Needs 4 to 7 volts: use a step-down converter. The + dot goes to the battery +.","A very thin hinge and a carbon-fibre frame keep it light even when it opens into a big screen.")
B.eAK=new A.em("vivo","vivo X300 Pro","\ud83d\udcf1",B.cP,"A premium vivo phone with a pro camera. Needs 4 to 7 volts: use a step-down converter. The + dot goes to the battery +.","A big camera sensor and a special lens system make sharp photos and portraits.")
